{"author": "pgaudet", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0019346 transsulfuration\n \nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/31702 \n\nAnnotations and mappings that need to be reviewed are here: \n\n\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Rxi92ZKbwcha4VdPQ-urFNbvcc5RKmOXkczmCQ6RpJ8/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \n\n1 AspGD (fixed)\n2 BHF-UCL - done\n~2 FlyBase~ DONE\n3 RGD \n4 SGD\n\nThere is 1 InterPro mapping, 1 UniRule and 1 reactome. \n\n\n\nThanks, Pascale\n", "created_at": "2026-09-14T14:43:22Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to GO:0019346 transsulfuration", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-09-25T06:50:59Z"}
